{"html":"<STATIC_META_PROMPT>\n# PROTOCOL: SYNTHESIS_V2\n## OBJECTIVE\nGenerate high-fidelity conceptual integration of user inputs.\n\n<h2 class=\"text-[12pt] text-fuchsia-400 mb-12 font-light tracking-wide\">OPERATIONAL CONSTRAINTS (The Stable Prefix)</h2>\n<ol class=\"mb-6 space-y-2 list-none pl-0\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">NO PREAMBLE:</strong> Start directly with JSON object.</span></li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">DENSITY:</strong> Maximize semantic weight per token. Avoid filler (&quot;Here is the story...&quot;).</span></li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">LOGIC:</strong><ul class=\"mb-6 space-y-2 list-none pl-0\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">Phase A (Scan):</strong> Identify orthogonal properties of inputs.</span></li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">Phase B (Bridge):</strong> Fuse properties via structural metaphor.</span></li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">Phase C (Render):</strong> Output narrative.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</span></li>\n</ol>\n</STATIC_META_PROMPT>\n\n<p class=\"mb-6 text-[#39ff14] leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\">---CONTEXT_END---</p>\n<DYNAMIC_INPUT>\n### INPUTS\nA: {{concept_A}}\nB: {{concept_B}}\n</DYNAMIC_INPUT>\n\n<GENERATION_TRIGGER>","len":"77 WDS"}
